   104	    """Resolve *target_path* to its store ``.db`` and require it exists.
   105	
   106	    State 2 of the store-verb existence contract (decision/design/
   107	    store-verb-existence-exit-code-parity): a present ``.vertex`` whose store
   108	    ``.db`` was never written is *not yet materialized* — a distinct condition
   109	    from *written and empty* (write-receipt-vs-temporal-query at the exit-code
   110	    layer). All three store verbs (ticks/stats/verify) surface it as a clean
   111	    RC=1 with a named message rather than ticks' prior silent RC=0-empty.
